00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:15.090
in technical physics terms

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:16.930
are basically two different aspects

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:19.420
of one underlying physical law,

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:21.460
and that's called electromagnetism.

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:24.610
So that you can turn, a small
current can move a motor

00:16:24.610 --> 00:16:26.970
and spin a motor, you
could also spin that motor

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:27.970
and generate a current.

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:29.030
That's in fact how currents

00:16:29.030 --> 00:16:31.270
and electrical power generation works.

00:16:31.270 --> 00:16:34.370
So he discovered the
analog of that unification

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:36.190
in what's called the nuclear force.

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:37.980
It's not super important to get into,

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:41.740
